Rust dependency notices
=======================

This file records the third-party Rust crates that appear in the shipped
`rados-rs` crate. Every version is exactly pinned in `Cargo.toml` (`=X.Y.Z`).
Copyright, licence, and source lines below are verified against each crate's
upstream repository. Qualification-only tool crates (used only by
`rados-r13-tools`, `rados-r0*-tools`, or the fuzz package) are listed
separately at the bottom and are excluded from the shipped crate archive by
the `Cargo.toml` `include` list.

