Bookkeeping
-----------

- Every direct dependency's licence appears on the `deny.toml`
  `licenses.allow` list (`Apache-2.0`, `LGPL-2.1-only`, `MIT`,
  `Unicode-3.0`, `Unlicense`) except `ed25519-dalek 2.1.1`, which is
  `BSD-3-Clause` and enters only the R13 qualification tool graph that
  the shipped crate archive excludes.
- Multiple-version drift in the ed25519-dalek/curve25519-dalek transitive
  graph (older RustCrypto stack) is declared in `deny.toml` under `bans.skip`.
- Complete pinned dependency graphs live in `Cargo.lock` and are surveyed
  in `docs/r02/dependencies.md` and `docs/r13/dependencies.md`.
